sequenceDiagram
    actor G as Guest
    participant V as Vue App
    participant A as Express API
    participant M as MongoDB

    G->>V: Choose dates and click "Book Now"
    V->>A: POST /api/bookings (token, roomId, dates, guests)
    A->>A: Check token (protect middleware)
    A->>A: Validate dates and number of guests
    A->>M: Find room
    A->>M: Find overlapping booking for this room
    alt Room already booked
        M-->>A: Booking found
        A-->>V: 400 "Room already booked"
        V-->>G: Show error message
    else Room is free
        M-->>A: No booking found
        A->>A: totalPrice = nights × room price
        A->>M: Save new booking (status: confirmed)
        A-->>V: 201 Created
        V-->>G: Go to My Bookings with success message
    end
